<title>GERMANY: BADMINTON-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAARBRUECKEN, Germany 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>at $125,000 German Open badminton tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>3/4-Hock Ong Ewe (Malaysia) beat 1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-13 15-12</p>
<p>2-Rashid Sidek (Malaysia) beat 3/4-Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-11 15-7</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Jie Yao (China) beat 5/8-Mette Pedersen (Denmark) 12-10 11-4</p>
<p>5/8-Margit Borg (Sweden) beat Yuni Kartika (Indonesia) 11-6</p>
<p>11-3</p>
</text>
